## Prek Hooks

This project uses [Prek](https://github.com/prek/prek) for pre-commit hooks. Each hook can be run individually and set as required independently in GitHub workflows.

### Always Present

- **markdownlint**: Lints markdown files for style and consistency

### Available Hooks by Component

{% if 'nix' in components %}
#### Nix

- **nixfmt**: Formats Nix files
- **statix**: Lints Nix files for common issues
- **deadnix**: Checks for dead code in Nix files

{% endif %}
{% if 'python' in components %}
#### Python

- **ty**: Type checking with ty
- **pytest**: Runs Python tests
- **ruff**: Lints Python files
- **ruff-format**: Formats Python files

{% endif %}

### Usage

Run all hooks:
```bash
prek run
```

Run specific stage:
```bash
prek run --stage always
{% if 'nix' in components %}
prek run --stage nix
{% endif %}
{% if 'python' in components %}
prek run --stage python
{% endif %}
```

Run specific hook:
```bash
prek run --hook markdownlint
{% if 'nix' in components %}
prek run --hook nixfmt
prek run --hook statix
prek run --hook deadnix
{% endif %}
{% if 'python' in components %}
prek run --hook ty
prek run --hook pytest
prek run --hook ruff
prek run --hook ruff-format
{% endif %}
```

See [`.prek/README.md`](.prek/README.md) for more details.
